  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/658/658-8.htm",
  "statuteText": "658:8 Term. –\n\nThe term of office of each of the assistant election officials appointed as provided in RSA 658:7 shall expire at the termination of the proceedings at the election for which he or she was appointed."
